&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://pygargous.com/fruitClassificationWeb/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Get the manual by clicking here:https://pygargous.com/fruitClassificationWeb/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>About</title><link>https://Henry-city.github.io/about/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Henry-city.github.io/about/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m currently a bachelor student majoring in electronic and information engineering of advanced manufacturing college of Fuzhou University. My research topics are embedded and AI. In spare time, I like playing piano and reading.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the third year of the junior high school, I received the guidance of &lt;a class="link" href="https://faculty.uestc.edu.cn/zhengyonghao/zh_CN/index.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Prof. Yonghao Zheng&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class="link" href="https://sose.uestc.edu.cn/info/1032/6984.htm" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
&gt;Prof. Fucai Liu&lt;/a&gt; at University of Electronic Science and Technology of China and did some research on semiconductor and chips.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;During the first two years of university, I learned embedded and get the first prize of Fujian province of TI Cup National Undergraduate Electronics Design Contest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I am currently a research assistant at the School of Communication and Electronic Engineering, East China Normal University, with a primary research focus on artificial intelligence processing of medical imaging.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Chopin Etudes Op.10 No.5</title><link>https://Henry-city.github.io/p/chopin-etudes-op.10-no.5/</link><pubDate>Mon, 30 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://Henry-city.github.io/p/chopin-etudes-op.10-no.5/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://Henry-city.github.io/p/chopin-etudes-op.10-no.5/Chopin%20Etudes.jpg" alt="Featured image of post Chopin Etudes Op.10 No.5" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a class="link" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Lw411f74f/?p=5&amp;amp;share_source=copy_web&amp;amp;vd_source=ba52829fc5abc3932f2095d685059f96" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
